<title>USA: Bismarck, N.D., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Bismarck, N.D., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $4.025 million of Bismarck, N.D., refunding improvement bonds of 1997, Series G, with a net interest cost of 5.2686 percent.</p>
</text>
